  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under ASC 606-10-25-14(b), a series of distinct goods or services that are substantially the same and have the same pattern of transfer is treated as a single performance obligation. Each day''s cleaning is distinct and measured identically by time elapsed.
Wrong (A): The series guidance overrides individual treatment when both criteria (substantially the same and same transfer pattern) are met.
Wrong (B): Monthly grouping has no basis under ASC 606; the series provision applies to the entire contract term.
