  choices = $EXPL$["EITF consensuses are merely advisory opinions carrying no authoritative standing whatsoever","EITF consensuses are nonauthoritative guidance similar to textbooks and industry practice publications","EITF consensuses are considered only when no other specific guidance exists in the codification","EITF consensuses ratified by the FASB are codified with the same authoritative weight as other ASC guidance"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under ASC 105-10-05-1, the FASB ASC is the sole source of authoritative U.S. GAAP for nongovernmental entities. EITF consensuses ratified by the FASB are incorporated as Accounting Standards Updates and carry full authoritative status within the codification.
